Runtime: Current

Purpose:
  Defines current runtime state for crash recovery.

State:
  SessionID: SESSION-<TIMESTAMP>
  Task: TASK-<ID>
  Phase: <PHASE>
  LastStep: <STEP>
  NextAction: <ACTION>
  Status: <STATUS>
  Started: <ISO-8601>
  LastUpdated: <ISO-8601>

Recovery:
  On crash:
    Read this state
    Resume from exact state
    Do NOT restart workflow

Rules:
  [CR1] Current state MUST be updated after every step.
  [CR2] Current state MUST be persisted immediately.
  [CR3] Recovery MUST resume from current state, not restart.

State: +